### 1. GET Semua Layanan
GET http://localhost:5000/api/services

### 2. POST Tambah Layanan Baru
POST http://localhost:5000/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Surat Keterangan Domisili",
  "description": "Layanan pembuatan surat keterangan domisili untuk warga",
  "requirements": "Fotokopi KTP, Fotokopi KK, Surat Pengantar RT/RW"
}

### 3. PUT Update Layanan (Ganti angka 1 dengan ID yang ada di database)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/services/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Surat Keterangan Domisili (Update)",
  "description": "Deskripsi layanan sudah diperbarui",
  "requirements": "Hanya butuh KTP"
}

### 4. DELETE Hapus Layanan (Ganti angka 1 dengan ID yang ingin dihapus)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/services/1

### ==================== PROFILE ENDPOINTS ====================

### 5. GET Info Kelurahan
GET http://localhost:5000/api/profile

### 6. PUT Update Info Kelurahan
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kelurahan Woloan",
  "description": "Kelurahan Woloan adalah salah satu kelurahan di Kota Tomohon, Sulawesi Utara",
  "address": "Jl. Woloan No. 1, Tomohon",
  "phone": "0431-123456"
}

### 7. GET Semua Perangkat Desa
GET http://localhost:5000/api/profile/officials

### 8. POST Tambah Perangkat Desa
POST http://localhost:5000/api/profile/officials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bapak John Doe",
  "position": "Lurah",
  "photo": "https://via.placeholder.com/150"
}

### 9. PUT Update Perangkat Desa (Ganti ID 1 sesuai data)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/profile/officials/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bapak John Doe (Update)",
  "position": "Lurah",
  "photo": "https://via.placeholder.com/150"
}

### 10. DELETE Hapus Perangkat Desa (Ganti ID 1 sesuai data)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/profile/officials/1

### 11. GET Semua Lembaga Desa
GET http://localhost:5000/api/profile/institutions

### 12. POST Tambah Lembaga Desa
POST http://localhost:5000/api/profile/institutions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Karang Taruna",
  "description": "Organisasi pemuda Kelurahan Woloan"
}

### 13. DELETE Hapus Lembaga Desa (Ganti ID 1 sesuai data)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/profile/institutions/1